:58,"s":75,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"75:23","t":"Looking at their Lord.","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"75:24","t":"And [some] faces, that Day, will be contorted,","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"75:25","t":"Expecting that there will be done to them [something] backbreaking.","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"75:26","t":"No! When it [i.e., the soul] has reached the collar bones","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"75:27","t":"And it is said, \"Who will cure [him]?\"","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"75:28","t":"And he [i.e., the dying one] is certain that it is the [time of] separation","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"75:29","t":"And the leg is wound about the leg,","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"75:30","t":"To your Lord, that Day, will be the procession.","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"75:31","t":"And he [i.e., the disbeliever] had not believed, nor had he prayed.","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"75:32","t":"But [instead], he denied and turned away.","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"75:33","t":"And then he went to his people, swaggering [in pride].","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"75:34","t":"Woe to you, and woe!","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"75:35","t":"Then woe to you, and woe!","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"75:36","t":"Does man think that he will be left neglected?","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"75:37","t":"Had he not been a sperm from semen emitted?","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"75:38","t":"Then he was a clinging clot, and [Allāh] created [his form] and proportioned [him]","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"75:39","t":"And made of him two mates, the male and the female.","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"75:40","t":"Is not that [Creator] Able to give life to the dead?","j":29,"h":58,"s":75,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"76:1","t":"Has there [not] come upon man a period of time when he was not a thing [even] mentioned?","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"76:2","t":"Indeed, We created man from a sperm-drop mixture that We may try him; and We made him hearing and seeing.","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"76:3","t":"Indeed, We guided him to the way, be he grateful or be he ungrateful.","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"76:4","t":"Indeed, We have prepared for the disbelievers chains and shackles and a blaze.","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"76:5","t":"Indeed, the righteous will drink from a cup [of wine] whose mixture is of Kāfūr,","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":5,"sd":null}],"juz":29,"hizb":58,"surahs":[75,76],"sajdah":false}